+// the result is below `chance`. A skipped hit is a rest for its whole stay:
+// no `struck`, GATE low on every sample until the next landing, even if the
+// pattern changes under it. The pattern table is never touched, idle samples
+// never roll, load() never rolls, and nothing else consumes the generator,
+// so a seeded Rng replays the same skips for the same edges.
